WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Polish starts by removing things.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.909
Every extra shape or effect competes with your words.

3
00:00:03.909 --> 00:00:08.000
Take away what does not help the message and the animation instantly looks more confident.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.994
Let each line rest long enough to read.

5
00:00:09.994 --> 00:00:14.545
For short text a quarter of a second per word plus a short beat is a good starting point.

6
00:00:14.545 --> 00:00:17.000
If you have to hurry to read it, it is too fast.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.034
Shrink your animation down to thumbnail size.

8
00:00:19.034 --> 00:00:22.605
If you can still read the words and see the motion, it will hold up on a phone.

9
00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:25.000
If it turns to mush, make the text bigger and bolder.

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.856
Before you export, check the basics.

11
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:28.402
Square format at 1080 by 1080.

12
00:00:28.402 --> 00:00:29.691
Thirty frames per second.

13
00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:30.825
MP4 under 8 megabytes.

14
00:00:30.825 --> 00:00:33.557
Loop it a few times to be sure the seam is invisible.

15
00:00:33.557 --> 00:00:35.000
Then watch it on your phone.
